e, giving a boost of power and control in both defensive and offensive shots. * NEW: Longer Handgrip Technology: 1.5 cm longer grip for a more comfortable two-handed grip. *NEW: Noene Inside is a technology applied to the handle of the racket that has been developed in collaboration with NOENE. The new anti-shock padel grip Noene Inside StarVie, exclusive to the brand's rackets and fitted as standard, absorbs and protects up to 96% of the negative energy generated by shocks and vibrations. Specifications: Shape: Round Balance: Low Level: Intermediate Core: Soft 30 rubber Face: Carbon Weight: 350-385 G Surface: Rugged Playing Style: Power- control", 'category': '', 'subcategory': '', 'gender': 'unisex', 'price': Decimal('14250.00'), 'original_price': None, 'currency': 'EGP', 'availability': 'in_stock', 'sku': 'SP-1418', 'barcode': None, 'gtin': None, 'rating': None, 'review_count': None, 'image_urls': ['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/9613/2316/products/sp-1418a.jpg?v=1704009020', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/9613/2316/products/sp-1418b.jpg?v=1704009020', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/9613/2316/products/sp-1418c.jpg?v=1704009020', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/9613/2316/products/sp-1418w.jpg?v=1704009020', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/9613/2316/products/sp-1418d.jpg?v=1704009020', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/9613/2316/products/sp-1418e.jpg?v=1704009020'], 'main_image': 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/9613/2316/products/sp-1418a.jpg?v=1704009020', 'product_url': 'https://www.intersport.com.eg/products/sp-1418-starvie-spain-unisex', 'material': [], 'colors': [], 'color_images': {}, 'sizes': [], 'variants': [{'variant_id': '752a59ae3df94fd713fefc80466b65c3c60499e114c193b0fe96ecf4b0f0e939', 'platform_variant_id': 44353175879900, 'sku': 'SP-1418', 'barcode': None, 'size': None, 'color': None, 'price': Decimal('14250.00'), 'original_price': None, 'currency': 'EGP', 'available': True, 'inventory_quantity':